OL,4,CPoundland news update                W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GThe future of Poundland hangs in the W5
OL,7,Gbalance as it faces a possible       W5
OL,8,Gcollapse into administration.        W5
OL,9,                                      W5
OL,10,GIts owner, US investment firm Gordon W5
OL,11,GBrothers, put it up for sale in      W5
OL,12,GSeptember, but then rejected offers  W5
OL,13,Gto keep the business afloat.         W5
OL,14,                                      W5
OL,15,GPoundland has a major presence on    W5
OL,16,Gthe High Street, with 600 stores in  W5
OL,17,Gthe UK and Ireland, where it trades  W5
OL,18,Gunder the Dealz brand.               W5
